    skos:prefLabel "Electric charging equipment"@en ;
    skos:definition "A physical unit of electric-vehicle charging equipment, modelled as a DATEX II Facilities SupplementalFacility that wraps a single ElectricVehicleChargingPoint. The DATEX II native counterpart closest to a physical charge point/EVSE unit as distinct from the (Vehicle)ChargingPoint concept itself." ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    dcterms:source "DATEX II EnergyInfrastructure: ElectricChargingEquipment (extends Facilities SupplementalFacility); hub-curated SKOS rendering." ;
    skos:narrower datex:electricChargingPoint .

